                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="383 1732 383 1747 1700 1747 1702 1732 1700 1701 1637 1688 1635 1688 1632 1688 1604 1699 1550 1688 1548 1688 1546 1688 1522 1699 1481 1688 1479 1688 1476 1688 1290 1699 1210 1688 1208 1688 1206 1688 1204 1688 1204 1690 1193 1701 1041 1701 1013 1688 1011 1688 1009 1688 952 1699 892 1688 890 1688 887 1688 842 1699 812 1688 809 1688 807 1688 805 1688 768 1699 736 1688 734 1688 731 1688 729 1688 727 1688 712 1699 690 1688 688 1688 686 1688 684 1688 682 1688 669 1699 586 1688 584 1688 582 1688 580 1688 563 1699 528 1688 526 1688 524 1688 521 1688 495 1699 428 1688 426 1688 424 1688 383 1699 383 1732"/>
                        </Shape>
